{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんみさみさ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暴風雨でしたが みなさん\nお家にはちゃんと帰れました？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天気悪いときは\nほんと 気をつけましょう(/ _ ; )\n明日からは晴れるみたいやし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/6823225/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＿＿＿＿＿＿＿_＿＿＿＿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日 レコーディング前に\nまいまい・みゅうみゅうと一緒に\n浅草にお出かけしてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京に出てきて 初！浅草！\nやったからめっちゃテンション"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/6823225/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも行ったときには\nお店が半分くらい閉まってて..(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次行くときはお昼から\nもっと人がいっぱいな時に行ってみたい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浅草は お芋の町。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさの大好きなスイートポテトと\n大学芋がいっぱいあって\nふたつとも食べました～ ^^"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/6823225/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お芋ソフトもあったし\nお芋チップスもあったし\nお芋羊羹もあったし....."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。もちろん全部は食べてません。\nソフト チップス 羊羹は我慢した！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また浅草行きたいな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/6823225/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今日はね。\nいつも若月ゆみさんにいじられ\n会話の内容をblogに取り上げられる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私が...ついに！\n取り上げる側に回ってみようと思います←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさの挑戦！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅうみゅうとの会話は\nツッコミ →若月\nボケ → 衛藤  が基本です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ 今日は誰が相手なのか？\n気になるその相手は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ以上のボケをかますといったら\nこの方が思い浮かぶでしょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/6823225/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや むしろこの方しか有り得ない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"畠中清羅。\n今みんなもそう思ったやろ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のせいたんとの会話な。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさが心理テストしよって\nせいたんもするーっちなって\nそれぞれ携帯とにらめっこで\n同じ心理テスト解きよって....."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねぇみさみさっ(^o^)！！\nんー？？なに～せいたん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今何問目ー？\n25問目ー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのさ、とがめるっち意味 何ー？？\nん～過ち とか失敗?を\n責めるっちことでー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ 過度 はー？？\n必要以上に  っち意味で( *｀ω´) どや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"拘束 (ってなんて読むん？\nこうそく。\n（これくらいみさでも分かる。）\nじゃあ意味はー？\nえ、字見たらだいたい分からん(´･_･`)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デジタルとアナログっちどー違うん？\nえ（；゜０゜）\nん...あー、えーっとね....\n地上波かそうじゃないかの違いかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長いものには巻かれろ っち何？\n(やばい...これ分からん..どうしよ\nみさなりの答えでいっか(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"困ったときには近くの人を頼りなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"森と林っちどう違うん？\n量。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ次これ何て読...\nう(/ _ ; )...せいたん もうやめよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はぁ、はぁ、はぁ（;￣O￣）\n危なかったぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初余裕こいて答えよったけどさ\nもう、せいたんレベル高すぎて\nついていけんわ（;￣O￣）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか！この文章力の無さ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会話の内容を上手く伝えたいのに\nみさ全然伝えられてない気がする"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/6823225/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度みんなにも 心理テスト\n出して見ようかな～？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかさ.\n音声ブログとかあればいいのにな！笑\n今ふと思った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それやったら\nめっちゃ楽しいと思うんやけどな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/6823225/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ絶対得意や( *｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/6823225/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日 上マスカラだけ make"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/6823225/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ久しぶりに......\nおやすみさみさシリーズ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験を乗り越え\n新しい学校生活が始まるみなさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみさみサクラサク"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/6823225/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この言葉を送ります。\n今日、明日 入学式の方が多いと\n思ったので(*^_^*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またねっ♪"}],"source":"archive"}